[eval_no_gt_route_reference_5x5] Protocol: ROUTE-ONLY causal reference. The full waypoint polyline plus previous filtered state/motion prediction selects the local search centre; current-frame GT is not used for inference.
[eval_no_gt_route_reference_5x5] 3-frame recurrent state -> v/a + heading/turn-rate -> heading-aware second-order inertial polynomial -> weighted-centroid visual observation -> GRU -> robust constrained route-coordinate Kalman -> one final MeanShift -> final XY.
[eval_no_gt_route_reference_5x5] Evaluation intentionally does not solve global acquisition/re-localization: every frame receives a bounded GT-centered local prior.
[eval_no_gt_route_reference_5x5] Estimated position may be corrected backward after an over-prediction; physical forward intent is represented by non-negative route velocity.
